<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Y-You won't be leaving with your life...</font>

170
00:13:56,940 --> 00:14:02,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll admit, he has the skills,
but his brain's a little...</font>

171
00:14:12,570 --> 00:14:15,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Stop wasting time,
Master Sergeant Murasaki!</font>

172
00:14:15,600 --> 00:14:18,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Put an end to the brat immediately!</font>

173
00:14:18,240 --> 00:14:23,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yes, sir, General White! Right away!</font>

174
00:14:23,110 --> 00:14:27,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Which means our fun's now over, kid.</font>

175
00:14:33,590 --> 00:14:37,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I won't hold anything back!</font>

176
00:14:37,200 --> 00:14:38,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Fine by me!</font>

177
00:14:44,280 --> 00:14:46,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Prepare to die.</font>

178
00:14:46,610 --> 00:14:50,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Me, die? Yeah, right!</font>

179
00:14:51,450 --> 00:14:57,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So that's how you speak to your elders?!</font>

180
00:14:57,450 --> 00:15:00,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm gonna tear you into little pieces!</font>

181
00:15:17,710 --> 00:15:19,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Alright!</font>

182
00:15:19,480 --> 00:15:21,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Die!</font>

183
00:15:40,660 --> 00:15:44,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're just like me now!
You've grown a tail!</font>

184
00:15:55,230 --> 00:15:58,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll take it out for you.</font>

185
00:16:07,230 --> 00:16:10,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How embarrassing! Unforgivable!</font>

186
00:16:28,270 --> 00:16:30,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now it's my turn!</font>

187
00:16:41,180 --> 00:16:45,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">M-My famous <i>Sasanishiki</i> sword...!</font>

188
00:16:45,080 --> 00:16:47,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Doesn't even begin to
compare to my <i>Nyoibou</i>!</font>

189
00:16:47,890 --> 00:16:50,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Do you still wanna fight?</font>

190
00:16:50,690 --> 00:16:52,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're pretty good...</font>

191
00:16:52,390 --> 00:16:55,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So let's fight unarmed!</font>

192
00:16:55,690 --> 00:16:58,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Unarmed is fine with me!</font>

193
00:16:58,830 --> 00:17:01,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You certainly are confident...</font>

194
00:17:12,400 --> 00:17:16,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Unarmed?! Lying is a dirty trick!</font>

195
00:17:16,470 --> 00:17:18,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Imbecile!</font>

196
00:17:18,170 --> 00:17:23,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Do you think dirty tricks really
matter in a battle for life or death?!</font>

197
00:17:23,150 --> 00:17:24,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, yeah...</font>

198
00:17:24,610 --> 00:17:28,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">When you put it like that,
I guess that <i>is</i> true...</font>

199
00:17:43,550 --> 00:17:46,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Excellent! Mission accomplished,
Master Sergeant Murasaki!</font>

200
00:17:52,190 --> 00:17:54,920
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Peace! Peace!</font>

201
00:18:09,790 --> 00:18:12,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">O-Ow...!!</font>

202
00:18:12,660 --> 00:18:16,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What...?</font>

203
00:18:16,160 --> 00:18:18,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That hurt! <i>Now</i> I'm mad!</font>

204
00:18:18,860 --> 00:18:23,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What a hard head!
You must have a diamond head!</font>

205
00:18:32,460 --> 00:18:35,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--<i>This is bad! He's serious now!</i>
--Alright!</font>

206
00:18:45,670 --> 00:18:47,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Take this!</font>

207
00:18:56,150 --> 00:19:00,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now you're going to pay!</font>

208
00:19:00,120 --> 00:19:02,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Where are you?!</font>

209
00:19:07,160 --> 00:19:09,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Go ahead and throw them, if you can!</font>

210
00:19:09,860 --> 00:19:11,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Alright!</font>

211
00:19:16,740 --> 00:19:20,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Did you see that, kid?
A ninjutsu <i>tatami</i> block!</font>

212
00:19:20,680 --> 00:19:22,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay, then in that case...!</font>

213
00:19:30,620 --> 00:19:34,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What a joke. I bet that
came as a surprise, huh?</font>

214
00:19:35,800 --> 00:19:37,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There aren't any!</font>

215
00:19:42,600 --> 00:19:44,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">N-Not enough <i>tatami</i>!</font>

216
00:19:44,630 --> 00:19:49,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I should've made it into a 6-mat room
instead of a 4.5-mat room, after all!</font>

217
00:20:01,870 --> 00:20:05,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Wait! Come back here!</font>

218
00:20:05,580 --> 00:20:07,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Fool!</font>

219
00:20:17,190 --> 00:20:19,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Another smoke bomb...!</font>

220
00:20:34,070 --> 00:20:35,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Huh...?</font>

221
00:20:35,410 --> 00:20:40,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well? I doubt you can follow me now!
This is the water strider technique!</font>

222
00:20:40,210 --> 00:20:44,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's nothing, I can make
it to that shore easily.</font>

223
00:20:44,750 --> 00:20:46,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Go ahead and swim across, if you dare!</font>

224
00:20:46,580 --> 00:20:53,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This artificial river has been stocked
with none other than piranhas!</font>

225
00:20:56,010 --> 00:20:58,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I dare you to try coming over here!</font>

226
00:21:01,910 --> 00:21:03,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Alright!</font>

227
00:21:06,650 --> 00:21:09,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I don't need to swim.</font>

228
00:21:13,290 --> 00:21:14,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hi!</font>

229
00:21:14,730 --> 00:21:17,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">A-Are you a frog or something?!</font>

230
00:21:19,300 --> 00:21:20,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay, so now what, Mister?</font>

231
00:21:20,870 --> 00:21:24,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Are you still going to fight?
Or do you surrender?</font>

232
00:21:26,130 --> 00:21:31,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Foolish imbecile! I would <i>never</i>
surrender to the likes of you!</font>

233
00:21:31,100 --> 00:21:34,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So what are you gonna do?
Either choice is fine with me.</font>

234
00:21:37,820 --> 00:21:40,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What are you doing?!</font>

235
00:22:00,640 --> 00:22:06,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I, Ninja Murasaki, will show you the
ultimate secret ninjutsu technique of all!</font>

236
00:22:37,220 --> 00:22:39,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The Split-lmage Technique!</font>

237
00:22:57,290 --> 00:23:01,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let's see... huh?! Which one?!</font>

238
00:23:01,000 --> 00:23:06,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well, kid?! Bet you can't
tell which is the real one!</font>

239
00:23:06,180 --> 00:23:09,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">They all look like the real one...
W-What an amazing technique!</font>

240
00:23:10,450 --> 00:23:12,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Die, kid!</font>

241
00:23:14,240 --> 00:23:16,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Aha! You're the real one!</font>

242
00:23:21,280 --> 00:23:24,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-Whoa, that was close!</font>

243
00:23:24,100 --> 00:23:26,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Dodged it...</font>

244
00:23:26,070 --> 00:23:30,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ah, so <i>you're</i> the real one! Why, you!</font>

245
00:23:40,490 --> 00:23:42,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What is this...?!</font>

246
00:23:48,510 --> 00:23:52,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's going on?
They all look like the real one...</font>

247
00:23:55,010 --> 00:23:58,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well? I bet you're surprised, huh, kid?</font>

248
00:23:58,580 --> 00:24:01,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Your technique is amazing, Mister!</font>

249
00:24:01,450 --> 00:24:02,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well, duh!</font>

250
00:24:02,980 --> 00:24:06,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We're all real, after all!</font>

251
00:24:06,320 --> 00:24:07,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Eh?!</font>

252
00:24:07,880 --> 00:24:11,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We five are none other than...</font>

253
00:24:13,120 --> 00:24:16,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...the Quintuplet Ninjas!</font>

254
00:24:27,430 --> 00:24:29,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Surprised, aren't you?</font>

255
00:24:31,080 --> 00:24:32,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's too early to be surprised.</font>

256
00:24:32,350 --> 00:24:35,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now that the ferocity I possessed alone
has suddenly increased five-fold,</font>

257
00:24:35,350 --> 00:24:39,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">all you can do is die, kid!</font>

258
00:24:39,360 --> 00:24:43,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You sure talk big! You were
never fierce to begin with!</font>

259
00:24:43,330 --> 00:24:47,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I see, so you're all real, then? Alright!</font>

260
00:24:47,600 --> 00:24:50,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll just finish you <i>all</i> off!</font>

261
00:24:50,370 --> 00:24:55,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Impudent little runt!
We'll slice you up into sashimi!</font>

262
00:25:10,160 --> 00:25:12,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The real one's right here!</font>

263
00:25:17,330 --> 00:25:19,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">And this one, too, while I'm at it!</font>

264
00:25:25,680 --> 00:25:27,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-Where is he?!</font>

265
00:25:33,520 --> 00:25:37,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">1, 2, 3... Just two left.</font>

266
00:25:37,090 --> 00:25:41,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What the...?
The kid looks like several kids!</font>

267
00:25:41,560 --> 00:25:46,430
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Be careful! He can use a
real Split-lmage Technique!</font>

268
00:25:52,280 --> 00:25:56,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-Why didn't you say so sooner...?</font>

269
00:25:56,110 --> 00:25:59,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What speed and power!</font>

270
00:26:03,990 --> 00:26:06,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now you're all alone again!</font>

271
00:26:09,130 --> 00:26:12,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This guy likes to do
nothing but run away!</font>

272
00:26:13,690 --> 00:26:16,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">D-Damn it! Watch this!</font>

273
00:26:20,630 --> 00:26:23,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey, Artificial Human #8!</font>

274
00:26:23,270 --> 00:26:26,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's your turn to play!
Take care of that little brat!</font>

275
00:26:30,580 --> 00:26:32,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Come back here!</font>

276
00:26:37,650 --> 00:26:39,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay, #8! Go!</font>

277
00:26:57,740 --> 00:27:02,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Yet another new enemy</i>
<i>stands before Goku?!</i></font>

278
00:27:02,110 --> 00:27:05,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Who or what is Artificial Human #8?!</i></font>

279
00:27:05,480 --> 00:27:10,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Will Goku be able to safely</i>
<i>rescue the village chief?!</i></font>

280
00:27:37,340 --> 00:27:40,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Oide fantaji</i></font>

281
00:27:37,340 --> 00:27:40,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Come along, fantasy</i></font>

282
00:27:40,210 --> 00:27:42,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Suki sa misuteri</i></font>

283
00:27:40,210 --> 00:27:42,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I enjoy a mystery</i></font>

284
00:27:42,850 --> 00:27:49,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kimi no wakasa kakusanai de</i></font>

285
00:27:42,850 --> 00:27:49,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Don't you go hiding your youth!</i></font>

286
00:27:49,390 --> 00:27:52,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Fushigi shitakute</i></font>

287
00:27:49,390 --> 00:27:52,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Wanting to perform the mysterious</i></font>

288
00:27:52,390 --> 00:27:54,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Boken shitakute</i></font>

289
00:27:52,390 --> 00:27:54,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Wanting to pursue the adventure</i></font>

290
00:27:54,890 --> 00:28:00,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Dare mo min'na uzu-uzu shite 'ru</i></font>

291
00:27:54,890 --> 00:28:00,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Everyone is itching to go!</i></font>

292
00:28:00,900 --> 00:28:06,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Otona no furi shite akiramecha</i></font>

293
00:28:00,900 --> 00:28:06,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>If you act like an adult and give up</i></font>

294
00:28:06,910 --> 00:28:13,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kiseki no nazo nado tokenai yo</i></font>

295
00:28:06,910 --> 00:28:13,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>You'll never unravel the mystery of the miracle!</i></font>

296
00:28:13,080 --> 00:28:24,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Motto wairudo ni motto takumashiku ikite goran</i></font>

297
00:28:13,080 --> 00:28:24,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Go on and try to live</i>
<i>even more wild and strong!</i></font>

298
00:28:24,220 --> 00:28:31,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Romantikku ageru yo, romantikku ageru yo</i></font>

299
00:28:24,220 --> 00:28:31,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I'll give you a romance,</i>
<i>I'll give you a romance</i></font>

300
00:28:31,760 --> 00:28:36,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Honto no yuki misete kuretara</i></font>

301
00:28:31,760 --> 00:28:36,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>If you will show me your true courage</i></font>

302
00:28:36,270 --> 00:28:43,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Romantikku ageru yo, romantikku ageru yo</i></font>

303
00:28:36,270 --> 00:28:43,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I'll give you a romance,</i>
<i>I'll give you a romance</i></font>

304
00:28:43,640 --> 00:28:52,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Tokimeku mune ni</i>
<i>kira-kira hikatta yume o ageru yo</i></font>

305
00:28:43,640 --> 00:28:52,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I'll give your pounding heart</i>
<i>a glittery, shining dream!</i></font>

